 # Jellyfin Onboarding & Controlled Media Contract (PW-D06)
 
 ## Readiness and Boundaries
-- **Status**: Jellyfin deployment readiness and OIDC integration verified via service epic requirements.
-- **Scope**: Lower-layer OIDC authentication and controlled media streaming are verified via browser journeys.
+- **Contract Status**: The browser journey and evidence contract is implemented.
+- **Runtime Status**: Deployment readiness is not established until a reachable HTTPS target, synthetic identities, a restricted library, controlled media, and a successful `post-deploy-jellyfin` evidence artifact exist at one exact Architecture SHA.
+- **Operator Gate**: `slarti/backlog#283` owns deployment and runtime-input provisioning; repository code does not deploy the service or invent credentials.
+- **Scope**: The runtime gate verifies authentication, authorization, and controlled media streaming without treating code review as execution evidence.
 
 ## Journeys & Selectors
 1. **Unauthenticated Smoke**: Access login page (`/web/index.html`), verify page title and render without credentials.
